                      <Value EvaluationMode="Constant">We hereby certify that our registration certificate under the GST act 2017 is in force on the date on which the sale of the goods specified in the Tax Invoice is made by us and that the transaction of sale is covered by the tax invoice has been effected by us and it shall be accounted for in the turn over and sales while filing of return and the due tax, if any payable on the sale has been paid or shall be paid.</Value>
